            "text": "Beko is a Turkish home appliances brand that was established in 1955. The company started as a small workshop that produced cookers and stoves, but, in the 1990s, they began to expand their product range into refrigerators, washing machines, dishwashers, as well as other household appliances. They have since become one of the largest appliance brands in Europe, with its products sold in more than 140 countries worldwide."
