      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In 2004, Beko became a subsidiary of the Ar\u00e7elik Group, which is a leading player in the global home appliances market. The Ar\u00e7elik Group is based in Turkey and has a diverse portfolio of brands, including Beko, Grundig, Blomberg, and Arctic. With the backing of Ar\u00e7elik, Beko has continued to grow and innovate, offering consumers a range of high-quality and affordable home appliances."
          }
