      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Beko has a reputation for producing reliable and efficient dryers that are packed with innovative features. One such innovation is dryers that incorporate heat pump technology that uses a refrigerant system to extract heat from the air inside the dryer drum, which is then recycled to dry the clothes. This serves to improve energy-efficiency over traditional dryers. Another key innovation that they have introduced on their dryers is the Aquawave drum technology, which features a specially designed drum with wave-like paddles that gently agitate the clothes and prevent them from getting tangled during the drying process and helping to reduce wear on the garments. Modern dryers may also include the HomeWhiz app allowing consumers to remotely control their dryer from their smartphone or tablet. The app also provides notifications when the cycle is complete or when the dryer needs maintenance."
