 Ar\u00e7elik Group is based in Turkey and has a diverse portfolio of brands, including Beko, Grundig, Blomberg, and Arctic. With the backing of Ar\u00e7elik, Beko has continued to grow and innovate, offering consumers a range of high-quality and affordable home appliances.</p>\n\n<p>Beko has a reputation for producing reliable and efficient dryers that are packed with innovative features. One such innovation is dryers that incorporate heat pump technology that uses a refrigerant system to extract heat from the air inside the dryer drum, which is then recycled to dry the clothes. This serves to improve energy-efficiency over traditional dryers. Another key innovation that they have introduced on their dryers is the Aquawave drum technology, which features a specially designed drum with wave-like paddles that gently agitate the clothes and prevent them from getting tangled during the drying process and helping to reduce wear on the garments. Modern dryers may also include the HomeWhiz app allowing consumers to remotely control their dryer from their smartphone or tablet. The app also provides notifications when the cycle is complete or when the dryer needs maintenance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Common Models:</strong></p>\n\n<p>DTLCE80051W<br />DTLCE70051W<br />DTGV7000W</p>\n\n<div class=\"clearer\"></div><div class=\"headerContainer\"><a class=\"selfLink\" href=\"#Section_Identification\" title=\"Link to this section\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span    class=\"fa-svg-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Pro 6.5.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license (Commercial License) Copyright 2023 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M580.3 267.2c56.2-56.2 56.2-147.3 0-203.5C526.8 10.2 440.9 7.3 383.9 57.2l-6.1 5.4c-10 8.7-11 23.9-2.3 33.9s23.9 11 33.9 2.3l6.1-5.4c38-33.2 95.2-31.3 130.9 4.4c37.4 37.4 37.4 98.1 0 135.6L433.1 346.6c-37.4 37.4-98.2 37.4-135